WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:04.690
The year is 2205 A.D.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:13.860
To annihilate the History Retrograde Army,
who scheme to alter history...

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.660
...we, who were born from swords,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.040
engage in mortal combat today as well!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:47.770
"Touken Ranbu Hanamaru S2"

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:01.170
Oh, there you are.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:05.270
Now, Master, let us begin today's work.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.690
"This anime is about the
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:14.480
of a certain group of
Sword Warriors in a certain citadel."

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:19.950
"Clear Mirror, Still Water"

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.560
Oh, you're up early!

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:49.270
You've been training every
day recently, haven't you?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.160
Yeah, I guess.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:55.860
The History Retrograde Army's been
getting stronger and stronger recently.

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:58.900
We had a tough battle yesterday
when we were dispatched.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.170
Oh, really?

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.200
I haven't been dispatched recently,
so I didn't know.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.950
Yeah, so I've been thinking of training more.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.580
This is perfect. Kiyomitsu, let's have a match.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.250
May I, as well?

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.630
Just because it's training
doesn't mean I'll go easy on you.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.400
It really feels like spring now, doesn't it?

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:37.450
It does. Spring really
is the perfect time to relax.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.820
I'll have a cup, too.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.400
Then, I'm counting on
you from now on, too!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.290
Are you done talking?

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.550
Yup.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:00.510
I'm Kashuu Kiyomitsu.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.760
I was the sword of Okita Souji
from the Shinsengumi.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.590
How about you?

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.430
I'm Taikogane Sadamune!

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.270
"51 - Tantou, Taikogane Sadamune"

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:15.270
I was used by Date Tadamune-sama,
the second son of Date Masamune-sama!

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.760
Which means...

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.020
Sada-chan!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.240
Micchan!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.490
It's been too long!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.110
I'm so happy to see you again!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.410
Kara, have you been well, too?

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.120
Yeah.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:38.540
I'm super happy that
we can all be together again!

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.510
I don't need to show this one around, do I?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.050
Nope, we'll do it.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.300
Roger.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.390
Then, I'm off.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:51.640
See ya!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:57.560
Now, now.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.060
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.530
It's fine.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.740
These little ones are warm.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.130
They seem to really like you.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.270
Kogitsunemaru,
you should try holding one, too.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:18.580
Even though they're babies,
they look quite fierce.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.510
Hey!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.840
H-Hey, wait a minute!

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.220
Now you are "Kotoramaru."

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.310
I am Kogitsunemaru!

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.100
There you are, Gokotai.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.440
Do you have a minute?

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.940
Wh-What is it?

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.980
Master wanted to ask you something
about the last time you were dispatched.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.280
Okay, I'll be right there.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:50.840
It's still a little chilly,
so let me keep holding them.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.660
Be good and help everyone out, okay?

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.670
Oh? Mikazuki-san, Kogitsunemaru-san.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:03.840
Ishikirimaru.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:06.040
It's the perfect weather
to sit out on the veranda.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.180
Oh, that bird's a mejiro.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.840
How elegant.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.640
It makes me want to write poetry.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.180
Ishikirimaru, would you like a cup?

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.600
I would.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:20.940
All right, I'm done!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.270
"Garden in the spring.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:27.190
Cherry blossoms are nice
but plum blossoms are, too."

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.740
That was great, Kane-san!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:29.860
Right?

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.700
Hmm, I see.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:35.240
Kasen-san, please add
a lovely second verse.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.120
Hey, don't do that--

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.760
Leave this to us!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.140
I won't let you get away!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:54.850
Kunihiro!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:55.970
Leave it to me!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:01.400
This guy's small, but feisty!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.650
As expected!

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.020
But...

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.160
Okay, you're all clean.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:18.820
Come now, don't go
overboard with your tricks.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:25.110
Interested in brushes, huh?
Do you want to compose a poem, too?

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.090
Hey, that tickles.

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:32.800
Now, let's rub you nice and dry.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.440
This tea is very delicious.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.020
Yes, it's very fragrant with a sweet aftertaste.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.030
Uguisumaru gave me some
of these tea leaves the other day.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.910
It goes very well with these tea sweets...

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.590
Oh dear, it looks like we're out.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.160
It's a bit of a nuisance.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.110
Thanks for waiting!

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:30.230
Kara-chan, what are you doing?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:30.990
Nothing.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.740
Huh? That's one of Gokotai-kun's tigers, right?

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.030
There are tigers in this citadel?

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.540
Wow.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.330
It was walking with this in its mouth.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.500
What?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.620
Man...

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.790
You think it was hungry?

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.380
Probably.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.150
But...

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.430
You can't just take things without asking.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:55.580
Bad.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.720
Sada-chan and I will clean up the sweets.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:03.310
Kara-chan, will you take
the tiger back to Gokotai-kun?

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.280
Okay.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:13.440
Oh? We seem to be missing a tiger.

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:18.170
It's fine. They're all very smart,
so I'm sure it'll return soon.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:25.580
It's a bit chilly with the wind.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.010
That's true.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.150
Oh, no!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.160
Is this the last one?

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:58.860
Yeah.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.990
But man, there are so many!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.210
Wh-What the--?

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.090
What's the matter?

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.510
Where are you going?!

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.230
It's all right.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:28.990
Come on,

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:30.900
come here.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:46.540
Oh, did you bring a baby tiger, too?

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.300
I have no intention of getting along.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.790
Do you know where Gokotai is?

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.460
Gokotai is...

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.970
Yamanbagiri?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.480
I-I'm saved...

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.020
You all right?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:22.200
Look out!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.500
I'm sorry I took so long!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.960
I got caught up talking to Master...

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.550
Wh-What happened?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.970
Mikazuki-san?

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:51.390
I see, these little ones
were told by Gokotai to help us,

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.020
so that was what they were trying to do.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.610
What do you mean?

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:59.030
Implements for composing poetry,

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:00.990
tea sweets,

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.450
and something warm.
They were trying to bring them to us,

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:08.790
and to get the cloth that
was in Kogitsunemaru's hair.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.290
You have my thanks.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.380
Is that what it was?

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.840
But you mustn't take brushes
without permission again.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:28.310
These tigers are smart and considerate.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:29.310
Yes!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.270
You guys did your best, huh?

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:39.530
Oh, then next time, I'll let you borrow my nue!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.630
That certainly does sound warm.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.520
Huh...?

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:57.570
Now, now.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.300
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.380
It's fine.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.190
These little ones are warm.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.780
There aren't enough...

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:07.890
"Garden in the spring.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.810
Cherry blossoms are nice
but plum blossoms are, too."

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.180
That was great, Kane-san!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.470
Right?

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.720
There haven't been enough
surprises in the citadel lately...

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.700
Oh? What are you doing in a place like this?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.830
You've come at a great time, Konnosuke.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:34.290
Do you have any good suggestions
for how to find new surprises?

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.550
I've got a good idea for that.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:46.220
"Sports Festival"

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.090
Sada-chan, what are you looking at?

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:47.380
"Spring Sports Festival"

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.890
"Participation Requirements:
3 Swords Per Team"

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.180
"Planning: Tsurumaru Kuninaga"
"In Cooperation With: Konnosuke"

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.350
Oh? A spring sports festival?

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.680
Micchan, is this...?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:14:02.070
"1st Prize Donated by Master"
"Gold"

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.190
Oh? Seems pretty extravagant.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.150
Looks like Master splurged.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:02.070
This gold thing's flashy and cool!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.990
Hey, Micchan, compete
in the sports festival with me!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.360
I want to team up with you again!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:11.370
That sounds good, but it says you
need three to a team to participate.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:15.050
Even if I join you, we're still short a sword.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:19.170
Hey, Kara! Join our team
for the sports festival!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.060
I have no intention of getting along.

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:36.140
I have no intention of getting along...

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.890
Is that the prize? Wow!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:40.930
Welcome!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.110
This is Tsurumaru Kuninaga.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:47.440
We are about to begin the
first sports festival of this citadel.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.420
I'll be your announcer for
today along with Konnosuke.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.480
Please watch from an objective position today.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.660
I've been looking forward to this, too.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:59.960
These five teams have gathered here today!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:02.630
"Team Ultramarine"

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.960
We'll win with this team and get the prize!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.760
Yeah, let's do our best.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.880
"Team Aubergine"

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:10.010
I'll definitely get the prize Master donated!

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.930
Since Osayo said so...

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.140
Well, I guess I'll go along with it.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:17.140
"Team Russet"

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.970
Let's win this and get drunk!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.310
If we're going to do it, we have to go all out.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.350
I'm not good at anything but stabbing, though...

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.360
"Team Goldenrod"

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:25.570
Make sure you don't drag us down, you fake.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.110
Let's work together today!

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.570
"Team Chartreuse"

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:32.410
All right! It's festival time! Festival time!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.280
I'm gonna be in the spotlight!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.790
All right, I'll do my best.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.580
If you say so, Hotarumaru,
then I have no choice.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:44.750
By the way, who made this arena?

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:48.630
Yamabushi Kunihiro,
Doudanuki Masakuni, and Tonbokiri!

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.980
Now, we will begin the competition.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.520
The first event is the scavenger hunt!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:10.720
Ready...

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:12.560
...go!

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:20.040
Use your muscles!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.790
"Black Clothes"

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:27.090
"Glasses"

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.550
"Cute Cord"

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.510
"Large Cloth"

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.760
What the--?!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.720
"Lots of Inari Sushi"

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.020
You little...!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.270
Kara, let me borrow your clothes!

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.770
Here.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.520
Th-The world looks warped...

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.780
Be careful not to break them.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:54.150
Please, let me borrow it for just a little bit!

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.990
What? Hmm, what should I do?

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.280
Come on, let me borrow it!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.290
I refuse!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.960
Please stop. The cloth will get dirty.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.460
The winner is...

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:12.090
Taikogane Sadamune!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:15.260
How was it? I was good, wasn't I?

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.460
You little... Next time...!

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:24.350
The next event is the three-sword,
four-legged obstacle course race!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:31.030
This will test the teamwork
between the three swords.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:34.280
Ready, go!

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.620
I must redeem myself!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.460
You're too enthusiastic!

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:46.920
We have to be in sync!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.550
I'll run it through!

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:04.310
Where is it?

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.140
Sada-chan, leave it to me.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.400
All right!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.320
Yes!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:19.070
--Wonderful!
--Wow!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.200
Let's keep on going!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.080
Next is the cavalry battle!

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.620
I got it!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:27.870
Fleetly...

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.250
Floating...

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:30.940
Fluttering...

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:33.240
Ball toss!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:36.170
Now we can toss in as many as we want!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.720
So, who will pick up the balls?

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.590
You didn't think about that part?!

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.230
And 3-on-3 tug-of-war!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:57.190
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.360
This is nice and easy.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.540
We have finally come to the last event--

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.750
A relay race with everyone!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.330
Everyone, to your marks.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:16.380
"Team Ultramarine"
"Team Aubergine"
"Team Russet" "Team Goldenrod" "Team Chartreuse"

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:16.380
In addition, this event is worth twice
as many points as the others!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.340
You can turn the tables in one go,

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.270
so everyone, do your best!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.270
Ready...

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:24.560
...go!

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.980
--Go! Go!
--Do your best!

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:33.020
First off, we have Yagen
and Hotarumaru rushing out!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:36.030
The other three swords seem
to have gotten a late start.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:48.580
Kara-chan!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.220
Oh, no!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:29.830
Sada!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.040
Leave it to me!

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:40.420
Sada-bou advances steadily after receiving
the feelings of Mitsu-bou and Kara-bou!

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.470
He pulls ahead of three swords! Amazing!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.600
We will win this!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.230
Looks like you're underestimating me.

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:54.140
What?

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.240
You can do it, Sada-chan!

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:04.320
Just a little more, Sada!

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:05.570
Go!

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.280
Do your best, both of you!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.500
I will not lose!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:16.080
The winner... will be me!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.100
"Gold"

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.760
I did it, Master!

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:38.230
Oh, I forgot to tell you.
That's not real gold.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.180
What?!

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:41.030
Look.

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:48.370
Surprises are necessary in life.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:52.740
Aw, man.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:58.210
It was fun, but it would've been
even better if we'd won as a team.

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:05.510
Now, why don't you eat this and cheer up.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:12.450
Wow...

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:14.280
You did a good job.

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:18.440
It's golden!

00:23:54.990 --> 00:24:01.550
"Proposals: Hidden Talent Show,
Volleyball Tournament, Culture Festival"
"More <i>Hanamaru</i> Next Week!!"
